WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.900
Why keep a dashboard as a file?

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:06.981
Because a workbook edited in the portal is
a change nobody reviewed, and an export

3
00:00:06.981 --> 00:00:12.062
of it can carry the subscription, resource
group and workspace into a repository.

4
00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:16.548
By the end of this chapter you can rebuild
the workbook's template from reviewed

5
00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:19.947
files, prove it has one tab per
daily check and no embedded I D's,

6
00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:24.637
and catch the portal edits that would
otherwise drift into production unreviewed.

7
00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:27.306
It's for the developers
and for the security

8
00:00:27.306 --> 00:00:30.120
operations engineer
who edits the workbook.
